{"change_summary":"Updated `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs` so the load path now distinguishes a genuinely valid serialized `stability_tracker` from the legacy schema-2 `StabilityTracker::default()` sentinel. The loader now reseeds tracker baselines when a schema-2 save includes that uninitialized default tracker but the migrated water state does not match those baselines, while still preserving valid historical trackers and the existing carbonate-cache pH repair path. In `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs`, I added a regression test covering a schema-2 payload with a present-but-unseeded tracker and verified that loading reseeds the baselines and prevents the fake first-day instability spike.","outstanding_risks":["Known unrelated architectural issue carried forward from prior review: `Engine::step_hours` still calls `enforce_invariants(&mut self.state)` before returning some invariant errors, so a rejected step can still mutate live state."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current save loader, migration flow, and stability-tracker reconciliation logic to confirm the remaining gap was the schema-2 case where `stability_tracker` exists but still contains the legacy default sentinel baselines.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Patched `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs` so `SaveFile::from_value` passes the source schema version into tracker reconciliation, and added targeted legacy-default detection that reseeds only schema-2 saves whose serialized tracker equals `StabilityTracker::default()` but does not match the migrated water state.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added regression coverage in `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs` for a schema-2 payload with an uninitialized serialized tracker, including a post-load `update_stability_tracker` check that proves the first daily stability pass no longer invents a swing.","order":3,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran focused formatting, save/load, and lint validation on the touched `tank_core` paths.","order":4,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load` passed: 19 tests passed, including the new `legacy_schema_v2_saves_with_unseeded_tracker_reseed_stability_baselines` regression.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core --tests -- -D warnings` passed with no warnings.","`cargo fmt --check --package tank_core` passed after formatting the touched files."]}